column11:
It's worse than using Builder for XML templates. Builder rocks- it is much more concise and comprehensible.  <a href="http://builder.rubyforge.org/" rel="nofollow">http://builder.rubyforge.org/</a><p><pre><code>  xml.form {
    xml.label "zipcode"
    xml.input :type => 'text', :name => "zipcode'
    xml.input :type => 'submit'
  }</code></pre>
